Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:11.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:17.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們暗塌谷帝國為什麼要做這種事？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:23.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們的所愛 希望我們這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:30.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}跨越迷茫 不成熟的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你特地跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奉國王陛下的命啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下吩咐說“這是關係到藍天大地命運的研究成果 務必要完好取回"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(820,960)}{\fs50}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:33.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有點為時過早了 還在研究中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,研究 是什麼研究？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:39.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,關於產生閃亮能量的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還能辦到這種事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 理論上沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:49.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,淨化兇暴獸時所釋出的閃亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:51.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠修復被破壞的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:54.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還能與暗塌谷能量抗衡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}研究筆記
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能用天空石產生大量的閃亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(800,960)}{\fs50}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:07.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至可以透過魔鏡平板來生成保護藍天大地城鎮的護罩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:15.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,既能防止敵人通過通道入侵城市 又能抵禦外部的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:22.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,簡單點說 就是讓城市完全變成安全地帶 能夠保護人民！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:31.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還不止這些 研究順利的話 還能夠淨化兇暴獸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還是第一次聽說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 我們藍色護衛隊也能實現淨化？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:42.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起啊 靠著一個人就研究到這個程度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:54.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟一直把自己關在房間裡 刻苦鑽研啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:56.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯啊 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啪啪啪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,靠一個人...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:12.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還在研究中 我會在傍晚把資料歸納好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:17.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 中間這段時間空出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那不如...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變成讓大家帶我逛街了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿這套衣服怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好看？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:43.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 非... 非常漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈... 哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 小蝶的衣服正正好好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,同一套 穿著比我更正呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼要帶我去哪裡呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是一個好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市 購物中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建築物裡有市場？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}歡迎複習第二集
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樓梯自己在動...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶居然在說話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:17.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小帕小帕 服裝市場在幾樓？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯... 材料的拉伸性這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要與你無可替代的伙伴們 一同走你們自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長她好像玩得很開心...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有時間嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想試試運動服的性能 有沒有打亂你的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:09.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能和颯拉拉隊長一起鍛鍊 是我的光榮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 在開始鍛鍊前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要認真做好熱身運動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（樹叢聲響...）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,噓！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,運動社團在運動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說說看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:39.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼... 什麼事...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起來想隱瞞的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正直的英雄哪會說謊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:56.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我就問一下... 大伙在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:00.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,噓！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟在為什麼煩惱？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有一瞬間 我忘記了自己正在戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:16.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們的所愛 希望我們這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,幼稚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky 危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不知道是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 你是在思索這個答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過的吧 "走你們自己的英雄之路"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"要與無可替代的伙伴們一同"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:46.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的 應該找伙伴們商量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這次不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:58.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要一個人思考 靠自己找到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一起商量嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼一個人去找答案...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:19.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是伙伴嗎 你也太見外了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:23.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,想要一個人承擔 你只是在逞強！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:31.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,或許你說的對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:38.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這次一定要靠我自己來思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要是無法向一人之下出拳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是無法面對我自己的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是無法找到答案的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年不也是 一個人努力下來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人完成了閃亮能量的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那件事和現在這件事 不能相提而論吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟做研究嘛 只有我能夠辦到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哪不一樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:09.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的感情 只有小晴自己懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:13.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是覺得小晴找不到答案？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:15.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:21.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 如果有我們能幫到的 你儘管說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:25.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你盡情地思考 儘管去煩惱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有能和我們商量的事情 就來找我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:35.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有這研究和舒適的運動服 我們便是無敵的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和平一定能夠到來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你很中意運動服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定能找到答案的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:11.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別停下腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有答案啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:44.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟該怎麼辦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,煩惱都爆表了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒進展呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,她大概需要喘口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.17,0:10:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}唯美著迷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:00.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天購物的時候才過來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事沒有一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:07.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 最近一直把自己關在房間裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就盡情地舒展翅膀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:15.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪裡呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:23.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:28.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你們在研究閃亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:29.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,徒勞之舉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:34.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量是最強的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然想趕上同一檔次...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,自作聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:43.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:00.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
