Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:12.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:17.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:18.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,還好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還行...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:31.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有集中精神戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,和上次一樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:37.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼動不了... 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:38.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:42.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,說出來不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:50.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:54.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不是跟我說 去跟一人之下說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:55.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:15:00.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你那麼在意他的話 不如去問個清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,問個清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去找一人之下問個清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把Sky送到一人之下那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讓她跟一人之下對話！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:29.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,送Sky過去 就是我們這些伙伴 現在能幫你做到的事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:32.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism... 大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:34.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣衝過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雙色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,速度的力量 飛揚起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇！兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:08.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸我們來應付！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:15.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雕蟲小技
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:42.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:45.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我為什麼會露出破綻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:54.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們的所愛 希望我們這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為我聽到了你說的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:02.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是知曉了我等戰鬥的理由 膽怯了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:03.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,疑惑到了今天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想 你也是為了某人而戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是跟我們一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:17.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是這樣的話 我們是不是不用再戰鬥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,幼稚無比
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然操心戰鬥的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:24.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,和上次一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:42.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為疑問猶豫 而對戰鬥產生迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:48.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你的迷茫 這座城市將灰飛煙滅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:55.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那你為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:56.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就不會迷茫？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就沒有煩惱？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:03.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為他人而戰鬥的你 究竟為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 能夠去傷害別人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:10.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 能夠讓人們苦惱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:12.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:17.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,即將消失的你 沒有知道的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:26.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對交戰對手的興趣 這件事的本身 我並不否定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:30.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你的興趣是感情驅動的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,城市會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:38.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這一切都是你引起了 咒罵你自己的幼稚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:41.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這就是不成熟的表現...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:44.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不成熟就不成熟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因為不成熟 我才想知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:54.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正是因為不成熟...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:58.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才要不再躊躇 才要勇往直前！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:04.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,如果思考煩惱 代表著不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不成熟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走你們自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我與伙伴們一同要走的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的英雄之路！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:49.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下 我們來談談吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
