Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:09.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.61,0:22:09.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}天空愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:12.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,孟達就是虛蜢達？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,960)}紋田
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:51.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾認為自己一無所有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:53.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我現在想像那個人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:55.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,為苦惱中的人們 加油助威！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:58.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經做好了思想覺悟！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡虹光！照亮心靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,960)}Prism shine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:41.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:47.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:52.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:01:00.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:05.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:09.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:11.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:15.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:20.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:26.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:41.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:46.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:51.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:56.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:59.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:07.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
